Z||000018||1FST2M6||11-09-2000||09:00 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstpass2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstpass2.jpg</A>  for a before photo... THANKS GUYS!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> i had my springs wound by a friend at a Pro Shop in braselton, Ga. they are a 2.25" drop and a progressive rate spring. an easy spring to get would be suspension techniques, or eibachs.  the sus tech are $150. from NOPI and the Eibachs are $180. <A HREF="http://www.nopi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nopi.com</A>  or <A HREF="http://www.cyberauto.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cyberauto.com</A>  or <A HREF="http://www.shox.com" TARGET=_blank>www.shox.com</A>   ||||reg||1
